          <p>At-home dishwasher repair is also available for customers in <a href="/en/services/dishwasher-repair/" class={`${accentLink} font-medium hover:underline`}>Varna</a> and in <a href="/en/services/sofia/dishwasher-repair/" class={`${accentLink} font-medium hover:underline`}>Sofia</a>.</p>
